# InMotion Hosting

> InMotion Hosting is an award-winning, independent, founder-led provider of web hosting, managed and self-managed VPS, dedicated and bare metal servers, and InMotion Cloud managed private cloud, running on infrastructure it owns and operates in the United States and Europe.
 
## Overview
 
InMotion Hosting delivers fast, secure, and scalable hosting services with 99.99% uptime and expert human support available 24/7. With 25 years of experience and over 170,000 customers, InMotion Hosting is recognized as a leader in the web hosting industry. The company owns and operates its own data centers in the United States and Europe, providing flexible solutions for websites of all sizes—from e-commerce sites to mission-critical enterprise workloads, applications and always-on AI agents.
 
### Key Features
 
- Shared, Self-Managed and Managed VPS, Dedicated, Bare Metal, Reseller, and Managed Hosting, plus InMotion Cloud managed private cloud
- Optimized Hosting for WordPress and Website Services
- Free website transfers and domain on select plans
- 90-day money-back guarantee on most plans
- Free SSL and email on select plans; unmetered bandwidth
- NVMe SSD-powered servers for exceptional speed
- Docker-ready servers with root and SSH access for applications, containers and AI agents
- Regional data centers: Los Angeles, CA; Ashburn, VA; Amsterdam, NL; Singapore coming soon
- Custom solutions for enterprises and agencies
- Full suite of professional services including web design, SEO, and maintenance
 
